{"type":"context.append_message","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"think","think":"Now I have a complete understanding of the functionality. Let me summarize the testing scope:\\n\\n**Functional Boundary:**\\n1. **Background task system** - create, monitor, stop, output acquisition\\n2. **Notification System** - Release, consumption, deduplication, confirmation\\n3. **Integration points** - Shell background mode, TaskList/TaskOutput/TaskStop tools, Wire notification events, LLM notification messages\\n\\n**User-perceived behavioral changes:**\\n1. Shell tool adds \`run_in_background\` and \`description\` parameters\\n2. Added TaskList/TaskOutput/TaskStop tools\\n3. Automatically send notifications to LLM context and Wire after the background task is completed\\n4. Notifications enter the context through independent \`<notification>\` messages\\n5. New \`Notification\` event type added to Wire protocol\\n\\n**Test Plan:**\\n1. **Normal Path** - Start background task, wait for completion, verify notification\\n2. **Boundary conditions** - timeout processing, repeated stop, invalid task_id\\n3. **Interruption/Cleaning** - Actively stop tasks and restore tasks after they are lost.\\n\\nLet me start formulating... [truncated]"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a complete understanding of the functionality. Let me create a test plan:\\n\\n## Summary of functional boundaries\\n\\n**Major changes:**\\n1. **Background task system** (\`background/\`) - a new module that supports background bash tasks\\n2. **Notification System** (\`notifications/\`) - independent infrastructure, supports multiple sinks (llm/wire/shell)\\n3. **New Tools** - \`TaskList\` / \`TaskOutput\` / \`TaskStop\`\\n4. **Shell tool update** - Added \`run_in_background\` + \`description\` parameters\\n5. **Wire Protocol** - Added \`Notification\` event type\\n6. **PythinkerSoul integration** - automatic claim/ack notification, restore active task snapshot after compaction\\n\\n**Test range:**\\n- Background task life cycle (Create→Run→Complete→Notification)\\n- Mission control tool (List/Output/Stop)\\n- Notification system (duplication, claim/ack, multiple sinks)\\n- Integration points (Shell background mode, Wire events, LLM... [truncated]"}],"toolCalls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_y3SXWWQIUysddnYoklaWhUeE","function":{"name":"SetTodoList","arguments":"{\\"todos\\": [{\\"title\\": \\"Preparing the test environment (creating an isolated work-dir)\\", \\"status\\": \\"in_progress\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Exploration Wheel: Verifying tool availability and interfaces\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Execution Wheel 1: Normal Path - Background Task Lifecycle\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Execution Wheel 2: Boundary Conditions - Timeout and stop\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Execution wheel 3: Interruption scenario - TaskStop and recovery\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Observation wheel: Check session products\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Report conclusion\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\"}]}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_BH2zd6kVzHhV4pIjKLSmrUeB","function":{"name":"Shell","arguments":"{\\"command\\": \\"SMOKE_DIR=\\\\\\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/pythinker-smoke-XXXXXX)\\\\\\"\\\\necho \\\\\\"SMOKE_DIR=$SMOKE_DIR\\\\\\"\\\\n# Verify that the CLI can run\\\\nuv run python -m example_pkg.cli --help 2>&1 | head -20\\"}"}}]}}
